From 3a7a6325f91c60ce8b46f841a64180279c8d59c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wan <quanpham071204@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:29:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add ZfbfminD tests for BF16 NaN-boxing with FLEN=64

Add D rows to the Zfbfmin testplan, mirroring ZfhminD. They check that
BF16 results are NaN-boxed to 64 bits and that improperly boxed 64-bit
inputs are handled correctly. Map the new covergroups to the existing
normative rules.

Refs #2644

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AUtoM8BYihH5e3M9xVTA5S
